  "notes": "Lines numbered as in Audio/FelizNavidad.json (1-40). Structure: intro to 15s, chorus 1-8, verse 9-16, chorus 17-24, verse 25-32, final chorus 33-40 in the fade-out. Choruses: the short lines pass as a wave of pairs (left, middle, right, back) or from the outside in, with everyone on the long fourth line of each half. Verses: trio call and response, then a solo passing StairTree1->6; everyone on each verse's closing line. Lines 33-40 are crammed into the last 4.5s (LRCLIB timing; the recording fades from 129s and is below -20 dB after ~134s), so the whole choir mouths them together. Looks: rainbow party throughout: curtain-open intro with rolling eyes, rainbow chases and colour hits, rainbow wash and multicolour marquee in the verses, rainbow sweeps across the choir with white flashes on chorus 2, spirals and twinkles, butterfly finale with spinning rainbow eyes."
